OL,3,AVapes seized in schools spiked with
OL,4,Adrugs, Met says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne in eight vapes seized from pupils
OL,7,Fin south-west London schools contained
OL,8,Fillicit drugs, a Metropolitan Police
OL,9,Fscheme has found.
OL,11,FOfficers tested 32 confiscated devices
OL,12,Fusing specialist equipment, detecting
OL,13,Fsubstances including THC, the
OL,14,Fpsychoactive ingredient in cannabis,
OL,15,Fand Spice, a synthetic drug.
OL,17,FThe Met said a further three devices
OL,18,Fwere expected to test positive
OL,19,Ffollowing laboratory analysis.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
